{"quest_id": 4477, "name": "呪術師の呪い", "description": "戦場に現れた正体不明の呪術師。\n何やら様子がおかしいようだが……。\n＜味方ユニットの攻撃力減少：小＞\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "modifier_notes": ["味方ユニットの攻撃力減少：小"], "event": "呪術師と妖魔の女王", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920059, "map_no": 3160, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 180, "gold": 750, "drops": [{"card": 328, "c": 1}, {"card": 129, "c": 1}, {"card": 56, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 14, "params": [70]}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 32, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 5}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 55}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 180, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 180, "damage_type": "magical", "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 80, "attack_interval": 231, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098032, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 69, "global_id": 68, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 60}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "level": 90, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 30, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2104480, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 6, "master_id": 536, "global_id": 535, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 110}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "ウフフ……。\n久しぶりに地上界に戻ってきたけれど、\nやはり魔界とは勝手が違うわね。", "face": "l0cbd72e5092a"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ゴブリンクイーンさま……。\nニンゲン、ツヨイ。マタ、マケタ……。", "face": "lf246e35e5d04"}, {"name": "ゴブリンクイーン", "text": "仕方ないわ。ゴブリン種は最弱の魔物だもの。\nでも、心配いらないわ。この呪術師がいれば、\n誰にだって勝てるようになるのよ？", "face": "l0cbd72e5092a"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャッ！　ニンゲン、ヨワル！　\nオレタチ、カテル！　オレタチ、ツヨイ！", "face": "lf246e35e5d04"}, {"name": "ゴブリンクイーン", "text": "ウフフ……そう、アナタ達は強いの。\nワタシ達ゴブリンは人間などに負けないわ。\nそうよねぇ、レヴィ？", "face": "l0cbd72e5092a"}, {"name": "レヴィ", "text": "うん……ママ。", "face": "u328"}, {"name": "ゴブリンクイーン", "text": "ウフフ……そう、ワタシがあなたのママよ。\nさあレヴィ。ママをいじめる悪いやつらに、\nお前の呪いをかけておやり。", "face": "l0cbd72e5092a"}, {"name": "レヴィ", "text": "うん、わたし、がんばるよ。\nだからママ。\n今度は……置いていかないでね？", "face": "u328"}, {"name": "ゴブリンクイーン", "text": "ええ、もちろんよ。\nワタシのかわいいレヴィ。\nアナタは自慢の娘ですもの。", "face": "l0cbd72e5092a"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャギャ。さすが、ゴブリンクイーンさま。\nニンゲン、アヤツること、デキル……！", "face": "lf246e35e5d04"}, {"name": "レヴィ", "text": "ママ、わたし、行ってくるね。", "face": "u328"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 112, "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "あなたはこの前のレヴィさん、でしたよね？\nここはとても危険です。\nはやく、私たちのところへ……。", "face": "ldcb6e19dd989"}, {"name": "レヴィ", "text": "あなたたちが……。\nママを狙う、わるいやつら……。\nわたしの呪いで、みんな、死んでしまえ……！", "face": "u328"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "え？　あの女性は……！", "face": "ldcb6e19dd989"}, {"name": "フィリス", "text": "あの娘、やっぱり様子がおかしいよ……。\nまた……、力が入らなくなってきた……。\nどうしてなんだ、ちくしょうッ……！", "face": "u40"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、戦闘は避けられません！　ご準備を！", "face": "ldcb6e19dd989"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "レヴィ", "text": "……ふん、まだまだこれからなんだからね。\nみんな、すこし後ろにさがって。", "face": "u328"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャッ。サガル。テッタイ。", "face": "lf246e35e5d04"}, {"name": "レヴィ", "text": "みんな、いいこね。", "face": "u328"}, {"name": "フィリス", "text": "ゴブリン達と一緒に逃げていくって……、\n嘘だろ？", "face": "u40"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "とにかく追いかけましょう、王子！", "face": "ldcb6e19dd989"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920059_3160", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 944, "y": 401}, {"k": "m", "x": 809, "y": 361, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 708, "y": 371, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 605, "y": 353, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 512, "y": 330, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 422, "y": 367, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 310, "y": 388, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 203, "y": 358, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 111, "y": 365, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 234, "y": 282, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 260, "y": 196, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 346, "y": 151, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 426, "y": 102, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 522, "y": 57, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 612, "y": 44, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 696, "y": 79, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 759, "y": 137, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 782, "y": 261, "id": 216}, {"k": "r", "x": 855, "y": 281, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 899, "y": 315, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 837, "y": 424, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 749, "y": 421, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 485, "y": 273, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 246, "y": 437, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 179, "